{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega/v6.json",
  "description": "美国县级失业率分级统计地图（choropleth）：TopoJSON 数据 + lookup 连接 + albersUsa 投影 + quantize 填色",
  "width": 960,
  "height": 600,
  "padding": { "top": 46, "left": 8, "right": 8, "bottom": 8 },
  "autosize": "none",

  "title": {
    "text": "2009 年美国各县失业率（%）",
    "subtitle": { "signal": "'配色 domain 截断在 ' + format(rateCap, '.0%') + '：有 ' + cappedCount + ' 个县超出上限（最高 ' + format(maxRate, '.1%') + '），被一律夹进最深一档，彼此已无法区分'" },
    "fontSize": 15,
    "subtitleFontSize": 11,
    "subtitleColor": "#666666"
  },

  "signals": [
    {
      "comment": "配色 domain 的上限。分级统计地图几乎总要截断长尾，否则少数极端县把整张图压成一片浅色；但截断掉多少必须让读者看得见 —— 所以这里做成滑杆，并把被截断的县数写进副标题",
      "name": "rateCap",
      "value": 0.15,
      "bind": { "input": "range", "min": 0.05, "max": 0.35, "step": 0.01 }
    },
    {
      "name": "cappedCount",
      "update": "data('over-cap').length ? data('over-cap')[0].n : 0"
    },
    {
      "name": "maxRate",
      "update": "data('rate-extent').length ? data('rate-extent')[0].maxRate : 0"
    }
  ],

  "data": [
    {
      "name": "unemployment",
      "url": "../../assets/data/unemployment.tsv",
      "format": { "type": "tsv", "parse": "auto" }
    },
    {
      "comment": "落在截断线以上的县：数量随滑杆实时变化，直接写进副标题",
      "name": "over-cap",
      "source": "unemployment",
      "transform": [
        { "type": "filter", "expr": "datum.rate > rateCap" },
        { "type": "aggregate", "fields": ["rate"], "ops": ["count"], "as": ["n"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "rate-extent",
      "source": "unemployment",
      "transform": [
        { "type": "aggregate", "fields": ["rate"], "ops": ["max"], "as": ["maxRate"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "comment": "filter 必须同时管住「数据侧有值」和「几何侧有形状」两件事：us-10m.json 的 counties 里有 410 条 type:null 的占位要素（外加 5 条 arcs 为空的退化 MultiPolygon），其中 389 条查得到失业率 —— 只写 datum.rate != null 会把它们全部留下，渲染成没有 d 属性的空 path；反过来被 rate 条件丢掉的 34 条里有 13 条是真有几何的水域面（FIPS xx000，五大湖与近海）和美属维尔京群岛",
      "name": "counties",
      "url": "../../assets/data/us-10m.json",
      "format": { "type": "topojson", "feature": "counties" },
      "transform": [
        {
          "type": "lookup",
          "from": "unemployment",
          "key": "id",
          "fields": ["id"],
          "values": ["rate"]
        },
        {
          "type": "filter",
          "expr": "datum.rate != null && datum.geometry != null && length(datum.geometry.coordinates) > 0"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "states",
      "url": "../../assets/data/us-10m.json",
      "format": { "type": "topojson", "feature": "states" }
    }
  ],

  "projections": [
    {
      "name": "usa",
      "type": "albersUsa"
    }
  ],

  "scales": [
    {
      "name": "color",
      "type": "quantize",
      "domain": [0, { "signal": "rateCap" }],
      "range": { "scheme": "bluepurple", "count": 7 }
    }
  ],

  "legends": [
    {
      "fill": "color",
      "orient": "bottom-right",
      "title": "失业率",
      "format": "0.1%"
    }
  ],

  "marks": [
    {
      "type": "shape",
      "from": { "data": "counties" },
      "encode": {
        "enter": {
          "tooltip": { "signal": "'FIPS ' + pad(datum.id, 5, '0', 'left') + '：' + format(datum.rate, '0.1%')" }
        },
        "update": {
          "fill": { "scale": "color", "field": "rate" }
        },
        "hover": {
          "fill": { "value": "#e45756" }
        }
      },
      "transform": [
        { "type": "geoshape", "projection": "usa" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "shape",
      "from": { "data": "states" },
      "encode": {
        "enter": {
          "fill": { "value": null },
          "stroke": { "value": "#ffffff" },
          "strokeWidth": { "value": 0.75 }
        }
      },
      "transform": [
        { "type": "geoshape", "projection": "usa" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
